SMART SECURITY SYSTEM – PIN CONNECTIONS

ESP32 Pin           → Component
-----------------------------------------
3.3V                → PIR Sensor VCC
GND                 → PIR Sensor GND
GPIO 13             → PIR Sensor OUT

GPIO 2              → LED (+) through 220Ω resistor
GND                 → LED (-)

GPIO 4              → Active Buzzer (+)
GND                 → Active Buzzer (-)